---
/* CONFERENCE FAQ — 17 Oct, client note: "the current FAQs on the
   homescreen are all about the conference. It should move to the
   conference tab." Moved here verbatim from Faq.astro, which now carries
   the home page's new TGT-community questions instead. Same switchboard
   mechanic (see Faq.astro for the full rationale) -- styled in
   conference.css, driven by the shared /scripts/faq-switchboard.js. */
---
<section class="faq g-paper" id="faq" data-fade>
  <div class="faq__head">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin:0">Questions</p>
    <p class="faq__note">Everything people actually ask</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq__board" data-placeholder="P9">
    <div class="faq__index" role="tablist" aria-label="Questions">
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="0" data-on="1"
                aria-selected="true" role="tab" aria-controls="cfp0">
          <span class="faq__n">01</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Is it really free?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="1" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="cfp1">
          <span class="faq__n">02</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Do I have to be a Christian?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="2" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="cfp2">
          <span class="faq__n">03</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Can I come alone?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="3" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="cfp3">
          <span class="faq__n">04</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Am I good enough?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="4" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="cfp4">
          <span class="faq__n">05</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">What should I bring?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="5" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="cfp5">
          <span class="faq__n">06</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Where exactly is it?</span>
        </button>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__display">
        <p class="faq__answer" id="cfp0" data-i="0" data-on="1" role="tabpanel">Yes. No ticket, no fee, no catch. Register so we know how many chairs to put out.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="cfp1" data-i="1" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">No. No Bushels is cross-denominational and creatives-first. If you make things, you belong in the room.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="cfp2" data-i="2" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">Most people do. That's rather the point of it.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="cfp3" data-i="3" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">There's no bar. Bring whatever you're working on, however finished it is.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="cfp4" data-i="4" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">Yourself, and the thing you're making. Instruments, laptops and hard drives all welcome.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="cfp5" data-i="5" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">EU Centre, Warri · 21 November 2026. Full directions go out with your confirmation.</p>
      <span class="faq__wipe" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
